  "details": "Very simple physbone setup with long bone and cube in front of your face that you should be able to grab and move.\n\nIssue:\n\n-Grabbing this physbone is very unreliable in game, I grab it like 6/10 times with left hand and 3/10 times with right.\n\n-I do not see this collider on Physbone Proximity Overlay or see it randomly for few frames. I still grab it even if theres no overlay.\n\nExpected behavior:\n\n-I see grabbable part of component in Physbone Proximity Overlay when my hand is close\n\n-I 10/10 times able to grab it just by placing my hand inside the cube and making a fist gesture\n\nMore info:\n\n-Uploaded public avatar with it avtr_867cc9b2-4361-4b84-b0b6-c97c7cbf6d6d\n\n-Work perfectly in Unity's playmode mouse grab\n\n-Tried on two completely different avatars\n\n-Both 3.1.13 and 3.2 sdk\n\n-Squishy bones were enabled after the initial problem\n\n-Other props like Grabbable Prop work just fine with same upload",
